{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01721","headline":"杂曲歌辞 轻薄行 · 僧齐己","name":"杂曲歌辞 轻薄行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉鞭金镫骅骝蹏，横眉吐气如虹霓。\n五陵春暖芳草齐，笙歌到处花成泥。\n日沈月上且鬬鸡，醉来莫问天高低。\n伯阳道德何涕唾，仲尼礼乐徒卑栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}